mixin resumoOrder(totalProdutos = 0, total = 0, btnText = 'Finalizar Compra →', btnLink = '/pagamento', isSubmit = false, disabled = false)
    .card
        h2 Resumo da Encomenda 
        .info 
            p.total Total de Produtos: #{totalProdutos}
            p.nota *O levantamento da encomenda é feito apenas em loja.

        .preco
            p Total: 
            p.num= total.toFixed(2) + "€"

        if disabled
            button.checkout-btn.checkout-btn-disabled(type="button" disabled)= btnText
        else if isSubmit
            button.checkout-btn(type="submit")= btnText
        else
            a.checkout-btn(href=btnLink)= btnText

    style.
        .card {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            background: #FFF;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 80px 40px;
            max-width: 400px;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .card h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .info {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }

        .total {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .nota {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .checkout-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: var(--main-color);
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .checkout-btn:disabled {
            background-color: #b8b8b8;
            color: #fff;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.75;
        }

        .checkout-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--main-color-hover);
        }

        .preco {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .num {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }